# Android wrapper is kept local; this repo publishes the web prototype only
Sukinnect-Android/

# Build output and caches
build/
dist/
node_modules/
.gradle/

# A Python/uv download cache appeared in the working tree on 2026-10-12 — 44 MB of
# _cache/*.job and *.tmp, written by a tool outside this project. Nothing here runs
# Python: the prototype is one HTML file and every instrument in tools/ is Node, so
# this is machine scratch rather than project content. Ignored, not deleted, because
# whatever created it may still expect to find it.
Python/

# Machine-specific and secret local config
local.properties
*.keystore
*.jks
.env

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.tmp
*.swp

# screenshots written by tools/shot.cjs — looked at, not shipped.
# The pattern is open-ended because the tool is routinely pointed at a fresh
# --out directory to defeat cached image reads, and .shots/ alone let a scratch
# capture into a commit.
.shots*/

# Working copies the instruments write to compare against: a committed blob pulled out
# with `git show` to check a file that is being mutated under it, a mutant fixture a
# falsifier is about to install. Same reasoning as .shots* — they are read, never shipped,
# and a 780 KB duplicate of the app left untracked invites somebody to `git add .` it.
.scratch*/
